<title>CANADA: Toyota to build new coupe only in Canada.</title>
<headline>Toyota to build new coupe only in Canada.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Ontario 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp Canadian subsidiary Toyota Motor Manufacturing Canada Inc said on Wednesday that it intends to spend C$400 million to expand its Cambridge, Ontario plant to become the exclusive producer of a new two-door coupe.</p>
<p>Toyota in a statement said new car will resemble a convertible concept car called the Solara, which was revealed today at the Chicago International Auto Show.</p>
<p>The new coupe will be based on the highly successful front-wheel drive Camry platform, sharing its V6 powertrain but no sheet metal.</p>
</text>
